From: frogro <frank.grootens@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 02:32:08 +0100
Subject: [PATCH RFC 05/22] PCI: apple: preserve the measured M1 PCIe-C host
 and nonposted mappings

Adapted host derived from the Apple PCIe driver and imported DjDeveloperr patches 56ecc44554c7, 40f2afe0aefd and e32f89d3db2d, with subsequent local lifecycle, MMIO and resource fixes. Original file copyright preserved. The exact original imported mails are archived separately; this is a downstream adaptation, not an unchanged upstream commit. NVMe host driver unchanged. Reset acknowledgment semantics remain unresolved.

Consolidation is AI-assisted. No new upstream endorsement or Signed-off-by is asserted.
